{"aluminium":{"id":"b103c9fc-0fb2-4249-8450-9fc79782d230","word":"aluminium","trans":[{"lang":"Portuguese","code":"pt","lang_code":"pt","sense":"silvery metal","tags":["masculine"],"word":"alumínio"}],"pos":"noun","tags":null,"senses":[{"examples":[{"text":"There are plenty of reasons, Australians may reason, why our nation might be exempted from the threatened next round of Trumpian tariffs, on stuff like aluminium and pharmaceuticals.","ref":"2025 February 5, Annabel Crabb, “Donald Trump didn't invent brawling about tariffs. Australia gave it a red hot go”, in ABC News, archived from the original on 03 Apr 2025:","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[152,161]],"id":"0adbcd94-d64c-4e4f-892a-731b2db48716"}],"wikidata":["Q663"],"senseid":["en:Q663"],"links":[["bauxite","bauxite"],["atomic number","atomic number"]],"categories":["English terms with quotations"],"glosses":["A light, silvery metal extracted from bauxite, and a chemical element (symbol Al) with an atomic number of 13."],"tags":["countable","uncountable"],"id":"dfa0e357-8a5d-4b25-b250-c709e5c6a6ab"},{"categories":["English countable nouns"],"links":[["atom","atom"]],"raw_glosses":["(countable) A single atom of this element."],"glosses":["A single atom of this element."],"tags":["countable"],"id":"b89ae5c1-6eeb-4ddd-9492-03e2f5944745"},{"categories":["English slang"],"links":[["Aircraft","aircraft#English"],["machinery","machinery"]],"raw_glosses":["(slang) Aircraft or other machinery made partially or wholly of aluminium."],"glosses":["Aircraft or other machinery made partially or wholly of aluminium."],"tags":["countable","slang","uncountable"],"id":"f07f0929-e618-420e-82bd-fa3372ab690f"}],"related":[{"word":"algraphy"},{"word":"alum"},{"word":"alumane"},{"word":"alumina"},{"word":"aluminate"},{"word":"aluminian"},{"word":"aluminide"},{"word":"aluminothermy"},{"word":"andalusite"},{"word":"bauxite"},{"word":"Birmabright"},{"word":"chiolite"},{"word":"cobalt blue"},{"word":"corundum"},{"word":"cryolite